-> demi_follow

=== demi_follow ===
You: ...Where am I? I can't remember anything.
A little dog wags its tail and trots ahead.
You: You want me to follow? Alright, let's go.
-> END

=== postman_intro ===
At the edge of the village, you meet a mail carrier with a satchel.
Mail Carrier: New to Dori Village? Like an envelope with no address.
You: I... can't remember anything.
Mail Carrier: When the festival lights go up tonight, the Gate of Memory opens.
Mail Carrier: Lost visitors have found their memories there.
-> END

=== postman_named ===
Mail Carrier: Good. The whole village is getting ready for the festival.
Mail Carrier: Go to the square and lend a hand.
Mail Carrier: By the time the lights go up, this place won't feel strange.
-> END

=== prologue_01 ===
A lively square lies one way, a quiet lakeside the other.
You: Where should I head first?
* [To the busy square # item:prologue_01 # pick:a]
-> END
* [To the quiet lake # item:prologue_01 # pick:b]
